WEBVTT

01:27.585 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN" BY
XIE LOUNAN

01:34.625 --> 01:36.825
I love your baked pears the most.

01:40.265 --> 01:42.345
Your mother made them better.

01:43.785 --> 01:45.985
I can never get them to taste like hers.

01:48.665 --> 01:49.585
That's not true.

01:50.305 --> 01:52.025
I like your pears

01:52.745 --> 01:54.145
better than anyone's.

01:58.825 --> 01:59.785
Oh, yes.

02:00.905 --> 02:02.265
Jueding sent a letter.

02:03.145 --> 02:05.465
He mentioned your trip to Jiangzhou.

02:05.545 --> 02:06.545
That journey

02:07.705 --> 02:08.905
must've been hard on you.

02:11.185 --> 02:12.025
Not at all.

02:13.025 --> 02:14.785
I promised you and Mother

02:14.865 --> 02:18.105
I'd look after Jueding
and make sure nothing happens to him.

02:18.745 --> 02:20.865
Good. Very good.

02:21.505 --> 02:22.505
By the way,

02:22.585 --> 02:24.985
the day after tomorrow
is your mother's death anniversary.

02:25.065 --> 02:26.265
Come home and pay your respects.

02:30.065 --> 02:30.905
All right.

02:32.865 --> 02:35.025
Since Your Majesty plans to return home,

02:35.105 --> 02:37.905
there will be many things to prepare.

02:37.985 --> 02:40.705
This old minister will take his leave now.

02:43.025 --> 02:44.105
Father…

02:46.065 --> 02:47.265
the pears aren't done yet.

02:54.985 --> 02:56.665
I'll bake some for you next time.

03:25.905 --> 03:26.785
Father…

03:58.545 --> 04:01.945
LING MANOR

04:02.025 --> 04:05.625
WRITING

04:15.505 --> 04:16.384
My Lord.

04:16.985 --> 04:19.384
-Young Master Xianxue has returned.
-Where is he?

04:21.025 --> 04:23.425
He found out
that we poisoned the Young Lady.

04:35.825 --> 04:38.225
I love your baked pears the most.

04:39.345 --> 04:40.465
Father…

04:42.185 --> 04:43.545
the pears aren't done yet.

04:49.585 --> 04:50.625
It seems…

04:53.105 --> 04:54.905
they already know the truth.

04:54.985 --> 04:56.105
My Lord,

04:56.945 --> 04:59.385
then won't he be a danger to us?

05:00.025 --> 05:01.145
He knows too much.

05:13.825 --> 05:14.785
Kill him!

05:48.065 --> 05:48.945
Your Majesty!

06:19.345 --> 06:20.225
Who's there?

06:22.665 --> 06:25.705
My own empress can't even recognize me?

06:28.945 --> 06:30.345
If I really hadn't recognized you,

06:30.425 --> 06:31.705
I would've started
swinging at you already.

06:36.025 --> 06:37.625
Why are you practicing
swordplay blindfolded?

06:38.505 --> 06:40.825
With my eyes covered, I can sense
the shifts in the air around me,

06:41.585 --> 06:43.265
and my sword work can improve.

06:44.865 --> 06:47.785
You're working this hard
because you're afraid I can't protect you?

06:48.585 --> 06:51.665
Don't say that.
I'm the proud leader of Fenglai Pavilion.

06:51.745 --> 06:53.665
When it really counts,
I can protect you too!

06:55.745 --> 06:57.145
You're right, Leader Ling.

06:57.225 --> 06:58.185
My apologies.

07:05.025 --> 07:07.785
Since… you're easy on the eyes,

07:08.385 --> 07:09.225
I'll let you off.

07:11.185 --> 07:13.305
Is my empress flirting with me?

07:14.025 --> 07:14.865
Can't I?

07:16.465 --> 07:17.305
You can.

07:23.985 --> 07:26.185
The day after tomorrow
is your mother's death anniversary.

07:30.145 --> 07:31.625
I can go back with you.

07:40.705 --> 07:41.665
I think…

07:43.625 --> 07:44.705
I'd better go alone.

07:46.305 --> 07:47.545
There are things I have to face on my own.

07:48.545 --> 07:49.745
I can't keep running away.

07:53.745 --> 07:55.625
Don't worry.
I'll take good care of myself.

07:58.545 --> 07:59.385
All right then.

08:05.225 --> 08:08.265
LING MANOR

08:41.865 --> 08:44.105
Cangcang, you're back.

08:44.905 --> 08:45.865
Father.

08:45.945 --> 08:49.105
I didn't see you just now,
so I came to look for you in your study.

08:50.985 --> 08:53.745
The crack on this
inkstone reminds me of the past.

08:53.825 --> 08:56.065
When I was little,
I knocked it over by accident.

08:56.145 --> 09:00.705
I was scared to death,
since it was your favorite inkstone.

09:01.825 --> 09:03.625
Back then,

09:03.705 --> 09:05.425
your mother risked her life to shield you

09:05.505 --> 09:06.865
and spared you a beating.

09:09.545 --> 09:10.585
I never thought

09:11.705 --> 09:12.985
you still remembered that.

09:19.625 --> 09:20.625
Of course I do.

09:22.905 --> 09:24.825
Your mother said,

09:24.905 --> 09:27.545
"It's just a crack. It still works fine."

09:29.345 --> 09:31.265
I never thought

09:32.065 --> 09:33.785
I'd keep using it all these years

09:34.945 --> 09:36.265
and still not throw it away.

09:41.825 --> 09:44.465
Father, let's go visit Mother.

09:46.705 --> 09:47.865
All right.

10:21.025 --> 10:21.865
Every year,

10:22.865 --> 10:26.265
you set out her favorite green plum wine
for Mother.

10:26.345 --> 10:27.265
That's right.

10:29.385 --> 10:31.945
Your mother loved her wine.

10:32.025 --> 10:34.865
Whenever she got tipsy,
she'd dance with her sword.

10:35.465 --> 10:36.865
I can never forget…

10:36.945 --> 10:37.785
SPIRIT TABLET OF
THE LATE LADY SHEN OF THE LING CLAN

10:37.865 --> 10:41.225
how she danced
with her sword beneath the plum tree.

10:42.105 --> 10:43.785
Every little thing about her,

10:45.505 --> 10:47.145
every memory,

10:49.385 --> 10:50.265
I still remember.

11:04.425 --> 11:06.025
Enough of that.

11:07.585 --> 11:09.265
Look what I've prepared for you.

11:10.545 --> 11:12.065
I knew you were coming today,

11:13.625 --> 11:15.505
so I went to the kitchen early

11:15.585 --> 11:17.065
to bake you some pears.

11:17.145 --> 11:18.145
See? They're still warm.

11:18.225 --> 11:19.505
Hurry, eat them.

11:20.545 --> 11:22.665
I just don't know

11:23.265 --> 11:24.585
if this batch tastes

11:25.745 --> 11:27.345
anything like your mother's.

11:44.105 --> 11:45.305
Father,

11:47.545 --> 11:49.265
on our way back to the Capital,

11:50.625 --> 11:51.865
we were ambushed.

11:53.785 --> 11:54.985
The assassin…

11:56.345 --> 11:57.585
was Luo.

12:07.905 --> 12:10.025
These days, I've been thinking,

12:11.305 --> 12:12.505
thinking for a long time.

12:13.625 --> 12:14.785
When I saw you again,

12:16.385 --> 12:17.225
what should I say,

12:19.225 --> 12:20.545
how should I begin,

12:21.425 --> 12:22.385
what should I ask?

12:24.745 --> 12:25.585
Go ahead and ask.

12:31.665 --> 12:34.145
If I do, will you answer me?

12:36.465 --> 12:37.465
Will you tell me the truth?

12:38.185 --> 12:39.025
I will.

12:39.745 --> 12:42.025
You know, in front of your mother,

12:42.745 --> 12:44.145
I never lie.

12:52.585 --> 12:53.425
Father,

12:55.145 --> 12:56.585
did you

12:57.945 --> 12:59.665
put Lovesickness Powder
into my pear blossom honey?

13:00.345 --> 13:01.625
I did.

13:05.625 --> 13:06.625
And did you…

13:08.985 --> 13:10.105
also poison it?

13:28.105 --> 13:29.105
I did.

13:40.345 --> 13:41.585
So…

13:43.345 --> 13:45.225
when you kept calling me Cangcang,

13:46.225 --> 13:47.985
calling me your precious daughter,

13:48.985 --> 13:51.225
-was any of that real?
-Cangcang!

13:53.865 --> 13:56.985
I was absolutely certain
His Majesty would save you!

13:57.065 --> 13:58.425
But you say an emperor is heartless.

13:59.785 --> 14:01.905
If you really believed he'd save me,

14:02.705 --> 14:04.705
is he heartless or not in your eyes?

14:09.425 --> 14:11.105
To you, Father,

14:12.105 --> 14:14.745
whether he's heartless or not
depends on which answer helps you.

14:18.825 --> 14:20.985
And whether
you love your precious daughter

14:22.865 --> 14:27.145
depends on whether she hinders
your grand plans. Isn't that right?

14:32.665 --> 14:35.625
Cangcang, you… you have to believe me.

14:36.865 --> 14:38.105
Sometimes,

14:38.185 --> 14:40.505
I have no choice but to weigh and choose.

14:40.585 --> 14:41.945
And everything I've done…

14:43.105 --> 14:44.545
was for our Ling clan!

14:44.625 --> 14:46.745
You've already made your choice!

14:50.305 --> 14:51.665
You chose

14:52.705 --> 14:54.985
to be a ruthless Grand Tutor,

14:56.225 --> 14:59.105
even at the cost of your daughter's life.

15:00.265 --> 15:01.185
Didn't you?

15:02.865 --> 15:04.025
Cangcang…

15:05.745 --> 15:07.625
I have my own reasons!

15:07.705 --> 15:10.185
The hunger for power is endless.

15:12.705 --> 15:14.585
Stop saying it's for me,

15:15.385 --> 15:17.665
for the Ling clan, for Jueding.

15:18.345 --> 15:21.305
If you stop now,
it's still not too late to turn back!

15:33.665 --> 15:35.345
Your Majesty,

15:37.825 --> 15:40.185
you want to teach me how to live?

15:54.105 --> 15:57.225
I can never repay all you've done for me.

15:58.625 --> 16:00.465
I only beg you:

16:01.305 --> 16:02.465
if you don't stop now,

16:04.665 --> 16:06.065
there'll be no turning back.

16:11.385 --> 16:12.745
Very well.

16:12.825 --> 16:16.225
So when Your Majesty went to my study,

16:16.305 --> 16:18.025
you were looking for evidence?

16:18.105 --> 16:20.505
Did you really think no
one else would expose you?

16:20.585 --> 16:22.225
You mean Luo Xianxue?

16:25.825 --> 16:28.145
He treasures you like his own life.

16:29.825 --> 16:31.105
For your sake,

16:31.785 --> 16:33.025
he can tell you certain things.

16:33.105 --> 16:34.745
But do you really think

16:36.745 --> 16:38.105
he could come back alive?

16:42.385 --> 16:43.705
What did you do to him?

17:19.065 --> 17:20.385
Luo is the foster son

17:21.184 --> 17:23.065
you raised from childhood.

17:24.985 --> 17:26.305
And you still wouldn't spare him.

17:29.465 --> 17:30.425
So tell me, Father…

17:31.385 --> 17:33.425
what will you do with
your precious daughter?

17:35.545 --> 17:37.145
Kill me?

17:42.825 --> 17:44.585
How could I bear to?

17:46.265 --> 17:47.705
"Her Majesty

17:49.185 --> 17:51.905
has returned home
to mourn her late mother.

17:52.545 --> 17:54.825
Overcome with grief,
she has fallen gravely ill

17:55.945 --> 17:57.105
and will remain here

17:58.185 --> 17:59.625
for a time". That is all.

18:00.345 --> 18:03.145
Do you really think
His Majesty will let you live?

18:04.305 --> 18:06.305
With Your Majesty in my hands,

18:07.145 --> 18:08.585
he won't dare act rashly.

18:15.545 --> 18:16.905
You chose him

18:18.305 --> 18:20.745
because in your heart

18:22.385 --> 18:24.505
he's a man of feeling and honor, isn't he?

18:26.705 --> 18:28.665
Yet he hurt you and lied to you!

18:29.305 --> 18:32.385
He even killed the master you loved most.
And now he wants to kill your father!

18:35.625 --> 18:36.585
And yet

18:37.985 --> 18:40.185
you still choose to stand with him?

18:58.385 --> 19:01.785
From beginning to end,
I never meant to kill you.

19:08.025 --> 19:10.585
Did you think
that by getting rid of Luo Xianxue,

19:10.665 --> 19:13.225
you could erase
your ties to the Lingbi Sect

19:13.305 --> 19:14.865
and the proof of
your treason and regicide?

19:16.425 --> 19:19.185
I have far too much evidence
of your crimes in my hands.

19:19.265 --> 19:20.385
Sir,

19:21.185 --> 19:23.865
do you recall a move
you taught me at chess?

19:24.705 --> 19:27.345
"Drive in a wedge
and shatter the formation."

19:29.265 --> 19:31.785
So, you used Luo Xianxue as that wedge

19:31.865 --> 19:33.985
to lull my pieces
into dropping their guard?

19:34.065 --> 19:35.065
That's right.

19:35.865 --> 19:38.505
If Luo learned you once poisoned Cangcang,

19:38.585 --> 19:39.745
he'd dig out the truth.

19:40.945 --> 19:44.185
But you would never leave
a piece you couldn't control.

19:44.265 --> 19:45.145
So,

19:45.985 --> 19:47.145
I let him go on purpose.

19:48.425 --> 19:50.745
While you were busy
purging your own ranks,

19:50.825 --> 19:53.665
I could tighten the net I'd cast.

19:54.705 --> 19:55.705
Secretly forging weapons,

19:55.785 --> 19:58.945
skimming off grain,
rigging prices, controlling intelligence…

20:00.105 --> 20:02.145
As an elder of two reigns,

20:02.225 --> 20:03.825
you've spent years weaving your power.

20:03.905 --> 20:06.945
To wipe it out in one stroke
is no easy task.

20:08.825 --> 20:11.705
Sir, for this day,

20:11.785 --> 20:13.625
I've been planning for many years.

20:19.425 --> 20:21.065
Since it's come to this,

20:22.665 --> 20:24.705
kill me or punish me as you please.

20:24.785 --> 20:26.065
I told you,

20:26.945 --> 20:28.585
I've never once thought of killing you.

20:30.465 --> 20:33.665
I'll spare your life
and spare the entire Ling clan.

20:33.745 --> 20:36.345
I will not allow my empress

20:37.145 --> 20:38.705
to have a traitorous father

20:38.785 --> 20:40.305
and a rebel family.

20:50.905 --> 20:52.945
What did I always teach you?

20:53.905 --> 20:57.065
Remove the threat completely.
You never soften your heart.

20:57.665 --> 21:00.665
Letting me go today might just be…

21:02.505 --> 21:03.785
your greatest mistake.

21:20.745 --> 21:23.225
Sir, take care of yourself.

21:24.145 --> 21:25.665
Let's go, Cangcang.

21:30.025 --> 21:31.185
Cangcang!

23:10.545 --> 23:13.905
My Lord,
we failed to kill Young Master Xianxue.

23:14.665 --> 23:15.865
We await your punishment.

23:21.705 --> 23:22.905
He's no longer

23:24.185 --> 23:27.145
the Luo Xianxue he once was.

23:27.905 --> 23:29.945
He asked me to bring you a message.

23:30.785 --> 23:31.785
Speak.

23:33.185 --> 23:34.105
He said…

23:40.265 --> 23:41.345
Go back and tell my foster father

23:41.425 --> 23:43.345
he saved my life and raised me.

23:44.185 --> 23:45.345
More importantly,

23:45.865 --> 23:47.785
he's Cangcang's father.

23:47.865 --> 23:50.585
Hurting him is hurting Cangcang.

23:51.625 --> 23:52.545
That's something

23:53.345 --> 23:55.185
I would never do!

24:01.505 --> 24:05.865
After a lifetime of reading hearts,

24:07.625 --> 24:08.745
in the end,

24:09.625 --> 24:12.025
it was he who taught me a lesson.

24:15.865 --> 24:17.025
True.

24:20.025 --> 24:22.025
No one in this world

24:22.745 --> 24:24.865
can escape love.

24:30.185 --> 24:31.625
Once you care,

24:33.705 --> 24:35.345
you grow a weak spot.

24:38.625 --> 24:42.665
NANRONG PALACE

25:07.985 --> 25:09.905
Wash it carefully. There's a smell.

25:10.745 --> 25:14.705
You're the purest soul in Great Qi.
How could there be any smell?

25:25.065 --> 25:25.905
Madam.

26:03.665 --> 26:06.345
I never imagined

26:07.665 --> 26:09.425
that one day

26:10.145 --> 26:12.185
I'd drink tea personally brewed by you.

26:15.465 --> 26:16.865
Nor did I imagine

26:17.665 --> 26:18.785
that one day

26:20.505 --> 26:22.105
you'd dare come see me.

26:24.985 --> 26:26.305
I haven't forgotten

26:26.825 --> 26:29.065
who forced my mother to her death.

26:33.905 --> 26:36.065
The situation left us no choice.

26:38.105 --> 26:40.425
The late Preceptor died for the sect.

26:41.025 --> 26:43.745
It was not one man's doing.

26:51.545 --> 26:52.985
We're both smart enough.

26:54.265 --> 26:55.225
Spit out

26:56.745 --> 26:57.625
what you came to say.

26:58.825 --> 26:59.665
All right.

27:01.425 --> 27:04.105
Tell me, to this day,

27:04.185 --> 27:06.425
do you still believe

27:07.265 --> 27:10.665
you'll serve
His Majesty alone all your life?

27:14.825 --> 27:15.865
What are you getting at?

27:19.785 --> 27:21.585
Here's a letter.

27:22.545 --> 27:24.305
It holds a secret I've kept

27:24.385 --> 27:26.225
for the imperial
family for over ten years.

27:26.305 --> 27:27.985
You can read it.

27:29.945 --> 27:31.585
Read it on your own.

27:32.545 --> 27:35.545
When you've finished, think carefully

27:36.225 --> 27:38.825
about what I just said.

27:47.225 --> 27:48.505
It smells wonderful.

27:49.105 --> 27:51.745
This top-quality jasmine tea

27:51.825 --> 27:54.905
really does have a pure, lofty aroma.

27:55.905 --> 27:59.625
But once you taste it,
it's fierce and overpowering,

28:00.825 --> 28:05.425
nothing like its calm, desireless scent.

28:24.625 --> 28:26.745
Madam, you know what?

28:26.825 --> 28:29.105
You are the late Emperor's daughter.

28:32.545 --> 28:35.985
"All living beings are
trapped in love and hate.

28:36.825 --> 28:39.025
Though I serve as Imperial Preceptor,

28:39.105 --> 28:41.105
I cannot escape it either.

28:41.905 --> 28:46.345
I only pray my child
can escape this crisis

28:46.425 --> 28:48.225
and grow up safe.

28:48.825 --> 28:50.865
My child truly carries imperial blood.

28:51.865 --> 28:53.785
I swear on my life!"

28:55.345 --> 28:57.745
Is this blood-letter telling the truth?

29:19.865 --> 29:21.345
Nanrong…

29:26.425 --> 29:27.585
Nanrong…

29:30.065 --> 29:32.385
No wonder I'm so unwelcome in the world!

30:13.025 --> 30:15.345
CHANGHE GATE

30:51.345 --> 30:52.825
What great matter is this?

30:55.905 --> 30:58.785
I've served
through two reigns as Grand Chancellor,

30:58.865 --> 30:59.985
blessed with wise rulers.

31:00.065 --> 31:02.705
I rode to war with the late Emperor,

31:02.785 --> 31:05.465
and helped Your Majesty
open this golden age.

31:07.985 --> 31:10.985
That is enough for one lifetime.

31:30.225 --> 31:32.905
Now that I am old,

31:33.705 --> 31:36.425
I wish to retire to the hills
and lay down my burdens.

31:37.025 --> 31:39.505
I humbly ask Your Majesty
to grant this request.

31:55.705 --> 31:56.545
Granted!

31:59.825 --> 32:02.265
May Your Majesty
set your heart for Heaven and Earth,

32:02.345 --> 32:03.585
give the people a sure foundation,

32:03.665 --> 32:06.465
carry on the teachings of the sages,

32:06.545 --> 32:08.905
and open an age of peace for all time!

32:09.985 --> 32:11.025
May Great Qi

32:11.105 --> 32:12.865
endure for generations,

32:12.945 --> 32:14.425
its realm forever secure!

32:14.505 --> 32:16.225
I kiss the ground in thanks

32:16.305 --> 32:18.465
for Your Majesty's grace!

32:39.225 --> 32:42.585
A power in his own age,
pillar of two reigns,

32:44.905 --> 32:46.945
he retires just like that.

32:47.745 --> 32:50.305
Strike now, or he'll be a threat later.

33:04.505 --> 33:10.265
QI

33:17.545 --> 33:22.225
FUGUANG HALL

33:29.705 --> 33:31.625
I still remember

33:33.865 --> 33:35.585
it was right here

33:36.985 --> 33:39.505
you waited for me in the snow.

33:40.745 --> 33:42.865
You said you'd make me Grand Chancellor

33:44.345 --> 33:46.385
and make Cangcang your empress.

33:46.985 --> 33:49.465
I've done everything I promised.

33:51.785 --> 33:53.105
Your Majesty is true to your word.

33:53.705 --> 33:55.265
You'll always do exactly as you say.

33:55.905 --> 33:58.345
I promised to spare your life
and protect the Ling clan.

33:58.985 --> 34:01.465
I'll keep my word.
No need to remind me again.

34:04.585 --> 34:06.505
Then I have worried too much.

34:07.945 --> 34:10.065
I wish Your Majesty
and Her Majesty good health.

34:11.585 --> 34:12.945
From this day on,

34:13.545 --> 34:15.385
I only wish to find

34:16.625 --> 34:17.945
some quiet place of retreat.

34:20.465 --> 34:21.784
I will not return

34:23.824 --> 34:25.705
to this palace again.

34:50.665 --> 34:52.185
LING MANOR

34:52.264 --> 34:55.824
By His Majesty's command,
I am here to escort you to Deer Courtyard.

34:56.865 --> 34:58.185
Thank you, General.

35:47.785 --> 35:50.985
REFUGE IN THE DHARMA REALM

36:14.305 --> 36:15.665
Sir, what did you pray for?

36:17.825 --> 36:18.985
To retire in peace.

36:19.865 --> 36:21.625
Nothing more.

36:26.225 --> 36:28.465
And what do you wish for, General Lu?

36:30.785 --> 36:32.225
Only that the one in my heart

36:33.425 --> 36:34.585
stays safe and well.

36:35.985 --> 36:41.105
So, you're a man of feeling too.

36:45.025 --> 36:46.145
WUYING HALL

36:46.225 --> 36:49.185
Madam, you don't look well lately.

36:49.265 --> 36:52.345
You seem very pale.

36:53.785 --> 36:55.825
I have an urgent matter
and must see His Majesty.

36:57.305 --> 36:59.105
Is His Majesty really not here?

37:00.425 --> 37:01.825
I know…

37:01.905 --> 37:04.105
he hasn't wanted to see me lately,

37:04.185 --> 37:06.425
but this time it's truly important.

37:07.105 --> 37:08.585
Please, I beg you.

37:09.185 --> 37:10.025
Madam,

37:10.745 --> 37:12.705
His Majesty truly isn't here.

37:14.905 --> 37:15.865
Eunuch Feng,

37:17.865 --> 37:18.745
where is he?

37:20.385 --> 37:21.865
Where is he?

37:23.945 --> 37:25.385
Madam,

37:25.465 --> 37:27.385
forgive this old servant.

37:28.305 --> 37:30.505
His Majesty truly isn't here.

37:35.905 --> 37:39.145
WUYING HALL

37:43.585 --> 37:44.905
Your Majesty…

37:58.145 --> 37:58.985
Madam,

38:00.065 --> 38:02.545
shall I summon the imperial
physician to take a look at you?

38:02.625 --> 38:05.145
Physician Li is in the palace.

38:06.825 --> 38:08.145
No need…

38:09.025 --> 38:10.225
No need…

38:11.905 --> 38:13.025
No need…

38:22.065 --> 38:22.945
Madam,

38:23.945 --> 38:26.665
the wintersweet
in the imperial garden is in full bloom.

38:26.745 --> 38:28.625
Why not go and have a look?

39:07.865 --> 39:10.785
Cangcang, it's all over now.

39:15.465 --> 39:16.905
I often wonder

39:17.785 --> 39:19.385
if we had never begun,

39:20.425 --> 39:21.585
would things be different?

39:22.905 --> 39:23.865
Don't.

39:24.745 --> 39:28.625
There are no what-ifs.
Everything has already begun.

39:33.865 --> 39:35.665
Sky so vast, wild plains so wide…

39:36.385 --> 39:38.145
My mother named me Cangcang

39:39.265 --> 39:41.745
hoping that in this vast world

39:42.345 --> 39:43.505
I could live free and easy.

39:44.145 --> 39:46.425
If she could see me like this now,

39:47.465 --> 39:49.345
what would she think?

39:52.505 --> 39:53.425
Father said

39:54.305 --> 39:55.705
when you were fourteen,

39:56.425 --> 39:58.105
you waited for him
all night at Xishi Gate.

40:01.745 --> 40:03.345
It wasn't quite all night.

40:04.265 --> 40:06.585
I knew he would enter by Xishi Gate,

40:07.545 --> 40:09.945
so I went there at
the Yin Hour to wait for him.

40:10.785 --> 40:14.425
That day, snow was falling thick,
and it was bitterly cold.

40:31.265 --> 40:33.945
Your Highness, you've always been frail.

40:34.665 --> 40:36.865
Why suffer the cold here to wait for me?

40:37.825 --> 40:40.585
Sir, is your daughter named Cangcang?

40:40.665 --> 40:44.465
Your Highness,
I do have a girl named Cangcang.

40:44.545 --> 40:46.905
She's eight this year,
and terribly mischievous.

40:48.985 --> 40:50.225
Sir, are you willing

40:50.305 --> 40:53.465
to betroth her to me as my future empress?

40:58.305 --> 41:02.145
Your Highness,
do you know what you're saying?

41:02.825 --> 41:06.945
Today, I stand here in snow,
waiting for you.

41:07.625 --> 41:09.985
I know exactly what I'm saying.

41:18.865 --> 41:21.065
Your Highness, rise!

41:26.025 --> 41:29.145
Teacher, please accept my bow!

41:31.865 --> 41:36.465
If one day, I ascend the throne,
I will make you the Grand Chancellor,

41:36.545 --> 41:38.385
and make Cangcang my empress.

41:40.865 --> 41:42.585
Get up!

41:43.505 --> 41:44.905
You must be cold…

41:48.625 --> 41:49.545
So,

41:50.225 --> 41:52.305
how did your father see that day?

41:53.545 --> 41:57.505
Father said our engagement
was a deal struck ten years ago.

42:01.145 --> 42:02.425
He was being kind.

42:03.785 --> 42:04.745
Ten years ago…

42:05.945 --> 42:08.945
what right did I have
to bargain with Grand Tutor?

42:10.225 --> 42:13.785
I was only clinging to a last lifeline.

42:16.225 --> 42:17.225
Father also said

42:17.985 --> 42:21.745
that you from ten years ago
were no different from the man he is now.

42:24.345 --> 42:25.185
No.

42:26.345 --> 42:28.745
Back then, I only wanted to live.

42:30.465 --> 42:33.305
Cangcang, I am indeed a chess player.

42:34.425 --> 42:36.705
All my life, I've been playing the game,

42:37.705 --> 42:39.665
weighing gain and loss with every move.

42:40.305 --> 42:42.145
But taking you as my wife

42:42.905 --> 42:45.825
is the best thing
all my plotting ever won me.

42:53.505 --> 42:54.865
And hiding my true origins

42:54.945 --> 42:57.145
was just another move in your game?

42:57.225 --> 43:00.025
He's weighed gains and losses…
